{"id": "h-nb-201", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "अरे सुनो, चंपा... नहीं नहीं, रुक्मिणी का बच्चा है, आज चौदहवाँ दिन। वजन तौला दो किलो सात सौ। दूध अच्छे से खींच रहा है, नाल सूखी और साफ है, बदन ना ठंडा ना गरम, ज़ोर से रोता है।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Rukmini", "day": 14, "weight_g": 2700, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"cord_pus": false, "cold_to_touch": false, "hot_to_touch": false, "weak_cry": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["self-correction", "numbers-in-words", "negation", "filler", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-nb-202", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "शबनम की बेटी, तीसरा दिन, पसली चल रही है, साँस गिनी तो एक मिनट में बासठ, और दूध बिल्कुल नहीं पी रही।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Shabnam", "day": 3, "resp_rate": 62, "feeding": "none", "symptoms": {"chest_indrawing": true}}, "flags": ["nb_chest_indrawing", "nb_fast_breathing", "nb_not_feeding", "nb_sepsis_signs"], "tags": ["local-idiom", "numbers-in-words", "multi-sign"]}
{"id": "h-nb-203", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "भगवती के बेटे का वजन एक किलो आठ सौ ग्राम निकला, सात दिन का है, तापमान छत्तीस दशमलव नौ, दूध ठीक पी रहा है।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Bhagwati", "day": 7, "weight_g": 1800, "temp_c": 36.9, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": ["nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["borderline", "numbers-in-words", "celsius", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "h-nb-204", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बच्चा सुस्त पड़ा है, छूने पर ही हाथ पैर हिलाता है, और हथेली तलवे पीले दिख रहे हैं, दसवाँ दिन है, माँ का नाम कुसुम।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Kusum", "day": 10, "symptoms": {"lethargy": true, "jaundice": true, "jaundice_palms_soles": true}}, "flags": ["nb_jaundice_palms", "nb_lethargy"], "tags": ["local-idiom", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-nb-205", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "पार्वती के बच्चे को आज बुखार निन्यानवे दशमलव छह, बयालीसवें दिन की आखिरी विज़िट है, वजन साढ़े तीन किलो।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Parvati", "day": 42, "temp_c": 37.6, "weight_g": 3500}, "flags": ["nb_fever"], "tags": ["fahrenheit", "fraction-words", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-nb-206", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "ये बिंदेश्वरी का तीसरा बच्चा है, पर ये वाला अभी सात दिन का है। दो किलो नौ सौ ग्राम, सैंतीस डिग्री, दूध बढ़िया पी रहा, आँख में कीचड़ नहीं, पीलिया नहीं।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Bindeshwari", "day": 7, "weight_g": 2900, "temp_c": 37.0, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"eye_discharge": false, "jaundice": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["distractor-number", "numbers-in-words", "negation", "celsius", "local-idiom", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-nb-207", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "उफ़, लाजवंती के लड़के की नाभि लाल हो गई है, थोड़ा मवाद भी है, पाँचवाँ दिन, वजन ढाई किलो, बाकी सब ठीक।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Lajwanti", "day": 5, "weight_g": 2500, "symptoms": {"cord_pus": true}}, "flags": ["nb_cord_infection"], "tags": ["filler", "fraction-words", "borderline", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-nb-208", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "फूलमती के बच्चे को रात में दो बार झटके आए, आज दूसरा दिन है, बदन गरम लग रहा, थर्मामीटर नहीं था।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Phoolmati", "day": 2, "symptoms": {"convulsions": true, "hot_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_convulsions", "nb_fever"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "no-number-fever", "distractor-number", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-nb-209", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "तापमान पैंतीस दशमलव चार आया, बच्चा छूने में ठंडा है, वजन एक किलो छह सौ, इक्कीसवाँ दिन, माँ सरोज।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Saroj", "day": 21, "temp_c": 35.4, "weight_g": 1600, "symptoms": {"cold_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_hypothermia", "nb_very_low_weight"], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "celsius", "multi-sign"]}
{"id": "h-nb-210", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "haan toh nasreen ka baby pehla din hai aankhen thodi peeli lag rahi doodh theek pee raha weight 2 kilo 4 sau", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Nasreen", "day": 1, "weight_g": 2400, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": true}}, "flags": ["nb_jaundice_early", "nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["filler", "stt-style", "multi-sign", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "h-nb-211", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Gudiya ki beti, chautha din. Wajan teen kilo do sau gram, saans ginti pachpan, naal sukhi hai, dast ulti kuch nahi, doodh achha pee rahi.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Gudiya", "day": 4, "weight_g": 3200, "resp_rate": 55, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"cord_pus": false, "diarrhoea": false, "vomiting": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-nb-212", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Tarannum ka bachha, saatvan din, latrine mein khoon aa raha, ulti bhi baar baar, pet phula hua hai", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Tarannum", "day": 7, "symptoms": {"blood_stool": true, "vomiting": true}}, "flags": ["nb_blood_stool", "nb_vomiting"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-nb-213", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Kesar ke bachhe ka temperature 99 degree hai, doodh theek, zor se rota hai, 10 din ka", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Kesar", "day": 10, "temp_c": 37.2, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"weak_cry": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["fahrenheit", "borderline", "normal-visit", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "h-nb-214", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "उज्ज्वलाताईंच्या बाळाचं वजन पावणे दोन किलो, म्हणजे सतराशे पन्नास ग्रॅम, आज सातवा दिवस, दूध कमी ओढतं।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Ujwala", "day": 7, "weight_g": 1750, "feeding": "poor"}, "flags": ["nb_poor_feeding", "nb_very_low_weight"], "tags": ["fraction-words", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-nb-215", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सखूबाईंचं बाळ, चौदावा दिवस, वजन तीन किलो शंभर ग्रॅम, ताप नाही, नाळ कोरडी स्वच्छ, अंगावर पुरळ नाही, बाळ छान दूध पितं.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Sakhubai", "day": 14, "weight_g": 3100, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": false, "cord_pus": false, "skin_pustules": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-nb-216", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बाळ सुस्त झालंय, हलवलं तरच हलतं, अंग थंड लागतं, आज तिसरा दिवस, आई यमुना.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Yamuna", "day": 3, "symptoms": {"lethargy": true, "cold_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_hypothermia", "nb_lethargy", "nb_sepsis_signs"], "tags": ["local-idiom", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-nb-217", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "रेवतीचं बाळ, पाचवा दिवस, श्वास घेताना छातीत खड्डा पडतो, छाती आत ओढली जाते, मिनिटाला साठ श्वास मोजले.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Revati", "day": 5, "resp_rate": 60, "symptoms": {"chest_indrawing": true}}, "flags": ["nb_chest_indrawing", "nb_fast_breathing"], "tags": ["local-idiom", "borderline", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-nb-218", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "धनश्रीचं बाळ, एकविसावा दिवस, नाळ ओली आहे आणि भोवती लाल झालंय, अंगावर पुळ्या आल्यात, डोळ्यातून पिवळं पाणी येतं, बाकी दूध चांगलं पितं.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Dhanashree", "day": 21, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"cord_pus": true, "skin_pustules": true, "eye_discharge": true}}, "flags": ["nb_cord_infection", "nb_eye_discharge", "nb_skin_pustules"], "tags": ["local-idiom", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-nb-219", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "आईला थोडा ताप आहे, पण बाळाचं तापमान छत्तीस पूर्णांक आठ, वजन दोन किलो सहाशे, दहावा दिवस, आई मंगल.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Mangal", "day": 10, "temp_c": 36.8, "weight_g": 2600}, "flags": [], "tags": ["subject-ambiguity", "celsius", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-nb-220", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "जन्मानंतर बेचाळीसावा दिवस, वजन दोन किलो दोनशे, नाही नाही चुकलं, दोन किलो सातशे, दूध व्यवस्थित, अमृताचं बाळ.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Amruta", "day": 42, "weight_g": 2700, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": [], "tags": ["self-correction", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-nb-221", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Vaishalicha baal, dusra divas, baalala jhatke yetat, doodh ajibat pit nahi", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Vaishali", "day": 2, "feeding": "none", "symptoms": {"convulsions": true}}, "flags": ["nb_convulsions", "nb_not_feeding"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-nb-222", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Baby of Lalita, day six. Weight one point nine kilos. Temperature ninety-five point eight Fahrenheit and the baby feels cold. Feeding okay.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Lalita", "day": 6, "weight_g": 1900, "temp_c": 35.4, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"cold_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_hypothermia", "nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["fahrenheit", "numbers-in-words", "multi-sign"]}
{"id": "h-nb-223", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Okay so this is the day three visit, mother not around, grandmother says baby feeds well. Weight three kilos even, breathing forty eight a minute, no jaundice, cord is clean, cries loudly.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "day": 3, "weight_g": 3000, "resp_rate": 48, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": false, "cord_pus": false, "weak_cry": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "negation", "filler", "normal-visit", "no-name"]}
{"id": "h-nb-224", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Pramila ka baby, day 3, weight 1 point 7 kg, breathing count kiya to 66 per minute, chest andar ja raha hai saans lete time", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Pramila", "day": 3, "weight_g": 1700, "resp_rate": 66, "symptoms": {"chest_indrawing": true}}, "flags": ["nb_chest_indrawing", "nb_fast_breathing", "nb_sepsis_signs", "nb_very_low_weight"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "code-mix", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "h-nb-225", "lang": "mix", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बाळ limp आहे, touch केल्यावरच हलतं, feeding कमी आहे, temperature 37.8, day 9, आई कांता", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Kanta", "day": 9, "temp_c": 37.8, "feeding": "poor", "symptoms": {"lethargy": true}}, "flags": ["nb_fever", "nb_lethargy", "nb_poor_feeding", "nb_sepsis_signs"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "celsius", "code-mix", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "h-nb-226", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Day fourteen, Shalini's baby, weight gain ho gaya, ab 2 kg 850 grams, temp 36.6, no fits, no loose motion, feeding achha hai", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Shalini", "day": 14, "weight_g": 2850, "temp_c": 36.6, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"convulsions": false, "diarrhoea": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "celsius", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit", "code-mix", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "h-nb-227", "lang": "mix", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बच्चे का cry weak है, बस कुनमुनाता है, और potty में blood दिखा, week one पूरा यानी सातवाँ दिन, माँ रज़िया", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Raziya", "day": 7, "symptoms": {"weak_cry": true, "blood_stool": true}}, "flags": ["nb_blood_stool", "nb_weak_cry"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words", "code-mix"]}
{"id": "h-anc-201", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सुमित्रा का आठवाँ महीना चल रहा, बीपी डेढ़ सौ बटा एक सौ बारह, सिर में बहुत तेज़ दर्द है और आँखों के आगे अंधेरा छा जाता है।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Sumitra", "month": 8, "bp_sys": 150, "bp_dia": 112, "symptoms": {"severe_headache": true, "dizziness": true}}, "flags": ["anc_dizziness", "anc_headache_vision", "anc_imminent_eclampsia"], "tags": ["fraction-words", "months-not-weeks", "local-idiom", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-anc-202", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "गीता... नहीं, जानकी, बत्तीस हफ्ते, बीपी एक सौ बीस बटा अस्सी, हीमोग्लोबिन ग्यारह दशमलव दो, बच्चा अच्छे से हिल रहा, पैरों में सूजन नहीं, आयरन की तीस गोलियाँ दीं।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Janaki", "weeks": 32, "bp_sys": 120, "bp_dia": 80, "hb": 11.2, "fetal_movement": "normal", "ifa_tablets": 30, "symptoms": {"swelling_feet": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["self-correction", "numbers-in-words", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-anc-203", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "शांता की खून की जाँच में हीमोग्लोबिन साढ़े छह आया, थोड़ा चलने पर साँस फूल जाती है, छठा महीना।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Shanta", "hb": 6.5, "month": 6, "symptoms": {"breathless": true}}, "flags": ["anc_breathless", "anc_severe_anaemia"], "tags": ["fraction-words", "months-not-weeks", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-anc-204", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "कलावती की पानी की थैली फट गई, सुबह से पानी जा रहा है, दर्द नहीं है, छत्तीस हफ्ते।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Kalawati", "weeks": 36, "symptoms": {"leaking_fluid": true, "abdominal_pain": false}}, "flags": ["anc_leaking"], "tags": ["local-idiom", "negation", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-anc-205", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "मालती, सातवाँ महीना, बीपी एक सौ अड़तीस बटा नब्बे, एल्बुमिन ट्रेस।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Malti", "month": 7, "bp_sys": 138, "bp_dia": 90, "albumin": "trace"}, "flags": ["anc_hypertension"], "tags": ["borderline", "months-not-weeks", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-anc-206", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "रुको लिखो, सरला, वजन बावन किलो, हीमोग्लोबिन दस, खून नहीं गया, बुखार नहीं, चौबीस हफ्ते।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Sarla", "weight_kg": 52, "hb": 10.0, "weeks": 24, "symptoms": {"bleeding": false, "fever": false}}, "flags": ["anc_mild_anaemia"], "tags": ["borderline", "negation", "filler", "numbers-in-words", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "h-anc-207", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "इशरत का नौवाँ महीना, बच्चा कल से बिल्कुल नहीं हिला, और नीचे से थोड़ा खून भी आया।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Ishrat", "month": 9, "fetal_movement": "absent", "symptoms": {"bleeding": true}}, "flags": ["anc_bleeding", "anc_fetal_movement"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "months-not-weeks", "subject-ambiguity"]}
{"id": "h-anc-208", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "तारामती, पाँचवाँ महीना, बीपी एक सौ दस बटा सत्तर, खून साढ़े ग्यारह, उल्टी अब नहीं होती, सिरदर्द नहीं।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Taramati", "month": 5, "bp_sys": 110, "bp_dia": 70, "hb": 11.5, "symptoms": {"vomiting": false, "severe_headache": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["fraction-words", "months-not-weeks", "negation", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-anc-209", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Chhaya didi, 28 hafte, BP 142 by 92, albumin do plus, haath aur chehre pe sujan hai", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Chhaya", "weeks": 28, "bp_sys": 142, "bp_dia": 92, "albumin": "2", "symptoms": {"swelling_face_hands": true}}, "flags": ["anc_preeclampsia", "anc_swelling"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "numbers-in-words", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "h-anc-210", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Rehana, saatvan mahina, BP ek sau tees by assi, Hb barah, bachha theek hil raha, IFA sau goli de di", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Rehana", "month": 7, "bp_sys": 130, "bp_dia": 80, "hb": 12.0, "fetal_movement": "normal", "ifa_tablets": 100}, "flags": [], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "months-not-weeks", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-anc-211", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Arre haan, Bhavana ko kal raat daura pada tha, abhi hosh mein hai, BP nahi naapa, 34 hafte", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Bhavana", "weeks": 34, "symptoms": {"convulsions": true}}, "flags": ["anc_convulsions"], "tags": ["filler", "local-idiom", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "h-anc-212", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "रंजनाताई, बत्तीस आठवडे, बीपी एकशे साठ बाय एकशे दहा, अल्ब्युमिन तीन प्लस.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Ranjana", "weeks": 32, "bp_sys": 160, "bp_dia": 110, "albumin": "3"}, "flags": ["anc_preeclampsia", "anc_severe_hypertension"], "tags": ["borderline", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-anc-213", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "गंगूबाई, सहावा महिना, बीपी एकशे वीस बाय ऐंशी, हिमोग्लोबिन बारा पूर्णांक एक, सूज कुठेच नाही.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Gangubai", "month": 6, "bp_sys": 120, "bp_dia": 80, "hb": 12.1, "symptoms": {"swelling_face_hands": false, "swelling_feet": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["months-not-weeks", "negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-anc-214", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सुरेखाला चक्कर येते, डोळ्यांसमोर अंधारी येते, हिमोग्लोबिन सात पूर्णांक शून्य, नववा महिना.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Surekha", "hb": 7.0, "month": 9, "symptoms": {"dizziness": true}}, "flags": ["anc_dizziness", "anc_moderate_anaemia"], "tags": ["borderline", "local-idiom", "months-not-weeks", "numbers-in-words", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "h-anc-215", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "जयश्रीला थंडी वाजून ताप येतो, लघवीला जळजळ होते, पोटात खूप दुखतंय, वीस आठवडे.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Jayashree", "weeks": 20, "symptoms": {"fever": true, "burning_urine": true, "abdominal_pain": true}}, "flags": ["anc_abdominal_pain", "anc_burning_urine", "anc_fever"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "no-number-fever", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-anc-216", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "नंदिनी, पंचवीस आठवडे, वजन अठ्ठावन्न किलो, बाळ नीट हालचाल करतं, रक्तस्राव नाही, पाणी जात नाही, लोहाच्या साठ गोळ्या दिल्या.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Nandini", "weeks": 25, "weight_kg": 58, "fetal_movement": "normal", "ifa_tablets": 60, "symptoms": {"bleeding": false, "leaking_fluid": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "numbers-in-words", "subject-ambiguity", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-anc-217", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Aaj Sangitachi BP ghetli, ekshe chalis baay navvad, albumin nahi, aathva mahina", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Sangita", "bp_sys": 140, "bp_dia": 90, "albumin": "nil", "month": 8}, "flags": ["anc_hypertension"], "tags": ["borderline", "months-not-weeks", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-anc-218", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Mrs Kamal, thirty weeks. BP one forty-four over ninety-six, urine albumin one plus. Says her vision is blurry since morning and her face looks puffy.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Kamal", "weeks": 30, "bp_sys": 144, "bp_dia": 96, "albumin": "1", "symptoms": {"blurred_vision": true, "swelling_face_hands": true}}, "flags": ["anc_headache_vision", "anc_hypertension", "anc_swelling"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-anc-219", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Routine visit for Bhagyashree, sixteen weeks, BP one ten by sixty-eight, Hb eleven point zero, no bleeding, no burning urine, gave forty-five IFA tablets.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Bhagyashree", "weeks": 16, "bp_sys": 110, "bp_dia": 68, "hb": 11.0, "ifa_tablets": 45, "symptoms": {"bleeding": false, "burning_urine": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["borderline", "negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-anc-220", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Didi Sarika ka 8th month, BP 150 by 100, sorry galat bola, 130 by 84, albumin nil, aur baby movement kam hai kal se", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Sarika", "month": 8, "bp_sys": 130, "bp_dia": 84, "albumin": "nil", "fetal_movement": "reduced"}, "flags": ["anc_fetal_movement"], "tags": ["self-correction", "months-not-weeks", "code-mix", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "h-anc-221", "lang": "mix", "script": "devanagari", "said": "हिना को vomiting बार बार हो रही है, कुछ नहीं टिकता, बारह weeks, Hb नौ point चार", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Hina", "weeks": 12, "hb": 9.4, "symptoms": {"vomiting": true}}, "flags": ["anc_moderate_anaemia", "anc_vomiting"], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "watch-only", "code-mix"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-201", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सोनाली की डिलीवरी को तीसरा दिन, दिन भर में छह पैड बदले, बुखार एक सौ एक।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Sonali", "day": 3, "pads": 6, "temp_c": 38.3}, "flags": ["pnc_fever", "pnc_heavy_bleeding"], "tags": ["fahrenheit", "multi-sign", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-202", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "रामप्यारी, डिलीवरी के बाद सातवाँ दिन, बुखार सौ डिग्री, नीचे से बदबूदार पानी आ रहा है।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Rampyari", "day": 7, "temp_c": 37.8, "symptoms": {"foul_discharge": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_infection", "pnc_low_fever"], "tags": ["borderline", "fahrenheit", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-203", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "जच्चा ठीक है, चौदहवाँ दिन, दिन में दो पैड, बुखार नहीं, स्तन में कोई दिक्कत नहीं, पेशाब में जलन नहीं, नाम विमला।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Vimla", "day": 14, "pads": 2, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "breast_problem": false, "burning_urine": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-204", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "कमलेश की बोली अटपटी हो गई है, कुछ भी बोल रही, और आँखों से धुंधला दिखता है, दूसरा दिन।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Kamlesh", "day": 2, "symptoms": {"abnormal_speech": true, "blurred_vision": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_neuro"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "local-idiom", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-205", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Jaya ko delivery ke baad paanchva din, taap 102.4, saans phool rahi hai", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Jaya", "day": 5, "temp_c": 39.1, "symptoms": {"breathless": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_breathless", "pnc_high_fever"], "tags": ["fahrenheit", "multi-sign", "numbers-digits"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-206", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Mehrunissa, das din ho gaye delivery ko, teen pad roz, bukhar nahi, chakkar nahi, doodh pilane mein koi taklif nahi", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Mehrunissa", "day": 10, "pads": 3, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "dizziness": false, "breast_problem": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-207", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बाळंतपणानंतर चौथा दिवस, ताप एकशे दोन, म्हणजे खूप, आणि घाण वासाचं पाणी जातंय, हिराबाई.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Hirabai", "day": 4, "temp_c": 38.9, "symptoms": {"foul_discharge": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_sepsis"], "tags": ["borderline", "fahrenheit", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-208", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "बाळंतपण होऊन एकवीस दिवस झाले, दिवसाला दोन पॅड, ताप नाही, स्तन मऊ आहेत, पोटात दुखत नाही, नाव सुवर्णा.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Suvarna", "day": 21, "pads": 2, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "breast_problem": false, "abdominal_pain": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-209", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "ज्योत्स्नाला काल रात्री आकडी आली, आता शुद्धीवर आहे, तिसरा दिवस, अंग गरम लागतंय.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Jyotsna", "day": 3, "symptoms": {"convulsions": true, "fever": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_convulsions", "pnc_fever"], "tags": ["multi-sign", "local-idiom", "no-number-fever", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-210", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Delivery houn satva divas, Ashwini, taap nahi, raktasrav kami, divsala teen pad", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Ashwini", "day": 7, "pads": 3, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "heavy_bleeding": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-211", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Postnatal day two, Lakshmi. Soaked seven pads since morning, feeling giddy, temperature ninety-eight point four.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Lakshmi", "day": 2, "pads": 7, "temp_c": 36.9, "symptoms": {"dizziness": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_anaemia_signs", "pnc_heavy_bleeding"], "tags": ["fahrenheit", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "h-pnc-212", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Day 5 post delivery, Anjum ko fever hai, temperature 38.2, breast mein bahut dard aur lal ho gaya", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Anjum", "day": 5, "temp_c": 38.2, "symptoms": {"breast_problem": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_breast", "pnc_fever"], "tags": ["celsius", "code-mix", "numbers-digits"]}
